How can I display a personalized greeting message based on the user's name and time of day using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript? Can you provide a sample HTML code that uses JSON data format to store the user's name and time of day? Additionally, how can I make the greeting message responsive to changes in the time of day? 
Here is an example of HTML code that could be used to display the personalized greeting message:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Personalized Greeting Message</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<style>
		body {
			font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
			background-color: #f2f2f2;
			text-align: center;
		}
		h1 {
			color: #333;
			font-size: 4em;
